WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.440
Seven means complete. Four means the whole earth.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.550
Twelve means God's people: the twelve tribes, the twelve apostles.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:29.940
So 144,000 is not a head count. It is twelve times twelve times a thousand: God's whole people, complete.
